  "Writes (frame): %u   (%llu total)": "",
  "Writes a .cygimod folder: a readable mod.json plus one .cso per replaced shader, and the HLSL each was compiled from. Nothing about it is opaque — you can diff two versions of a mod, or hand-edit a note, without this application.": "",
